   "html": "<section class=\"hero\"><p class=\"desk-edition\">Daily refresh 2026-10-28 (SHORT Wednesday)</p><div class=\"hero-top\"><span class=\"hero-kicker\">Daily Summary</span><span class=\"badge cautious hero-regime\">Cautious</span></div><p class=\"headline\">Cautious — a bounce into the Fed, with the leverage still on.</p><ul class=\"hero-story\"><li class=\"watch\"><span class=\"st-dot\">🟡</span><span class=\"st-text\"><span class=\"st-lead\">FOMC-day lens</span>BTC bounced to ~$80.9k overnight but is still about −3.8% WoW and −3.2% MoM. The leading signal hasn't changed: 7d open interest is up 4.6% while price is down 2.6%, and funding sits near +9.5% annualised, so longs never cleared.</span></li><li class=\"watch\"><span class=\"st-dot\">🟡</span><span class=\"st-text\"><span class=\"st-lead\">Watch</span>on-chain cycle Bearish; dollar and yields rising.</span></li></ul><div class=\"hero-metrics\"><div class=\"hm sig-neg\"><div class=\"lbl\">BTC</div><div class=\"val\">$80,866</div><div class=\"chg\">7d -3.8% · 30d -3.2%</div><span class=\"sig neg\">🔴 Downtrend</span><div class=\"mean\">Weekly losses extend the monthly decline.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-watch\"><div class=\"lbl\">ETH</div><div class=\"val\">$2,352</div><div class=\"chg\">7d -4.8% · 30d -12.5%</div><span class=\"sig watch\">🟡 Lagging BTC</span><div class=\"mean\">ETH behind BTC this week.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-neg\"><div class=\"lbl\">Fed liquidity</div><div class=\"val word\">↓ Deteriorating</div><div class=\"chg\">4w flat</div><span class=\"sig neg\">🔴 Draining liquidity</span><div class=\"mean\">Net Fed liquidity fell in the weekly print.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-neg\"><div class=\"lbl\">Treasury cash</div><div class=\"val word\">↑ Rebuilding</div><div class=\"chg\">7d rebuilding · 4w rebuilding</div><span class=\"sig neg\">🔴 Removes liquidity</span></div><div class=\"hm sig-neg\"><div class=\"lbl\">BTC ETF flows</div><div class=\"val neg\">−$115M</div><div class=\"ch