   "html": "<section class=\"block card structure-card\"><h2>Market structure &amp; leverage <span class=\"tag\">rule-of-thumb</span></h2><p class=\"sec-story\">Structure neutral: no clear weekly trend — range-bound.</p><div class=\"struct-grid\"><div class=\"struct-col\"><div class=\"label\">Crypto market structure</div><div class=\"struct-chip neutral\">Neutral</div><div class=\"chg\">BTC 7d -3.8% · 30d -3.2%</div><div class=\"mean\">No clear weekly trend.</div></div><div class=\"struct-col\"><div class=\"label\">Futures <abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Open interest: total value of open futures positions. Falling OI = leverage being cleared out.\" tabindex=\"0\">OI</abbr> vs price</div><div class=\"quad-grid\"><div class=\"quad-cell\"><span class=\"q-name\">Spot Rally</span><span class=\"q-hint\">OI↓ price↑ · healthy</span></div><div class=\"quad-cell\"><span class=\"q-name\">Leveraged Rally</span><span class=\"q-hint\">OI↑ price↑ · fragile</span></div><div class=\"quad-cell\"><span class=\"q-name\">Deleveraging Sell-Off</span><span class=\"q-hint\">OI↓ price↓ · flush</span></div><div class=\"quad-cell active\"><span class=\"q-name\">Leveraged Sell-Off</span><span class=\"q-hint\">OI↑ price↓ · pressure</span></div></div><div class=\"src-link\"><a href=\"https://charts.checkonchain.com/btconchain/derivatives/derivatives_futuresoi_vs_price_scatter/derivatives_futuresoi_vs_price_scatter_dark.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">CheckOnChain · Futures OI vs Price</a></div></div></div><div class=\"sig-grid\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"hm sig-neg\"><div class=\"lbl\">Futures positioning</div><div class=\"val word\">Leveraged Sell-Off</div><div class=\"chg\">OI 7d +4.6%</div><span class=\"sig neg\">🔴 Shorts pressing</span><div class=\"mean\">Futures OI +4.6% WoW: new leverage behind the decline.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos\"><div class=\"lbl\">Funding</div><div class=\"val word\">+9.5% ann.</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Calm</span><div class=\"mean\">